WEBVTT

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:15.469
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> Hi, Jenny.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.240
What a surprise!

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.502
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Hi, Steve!

00:00:20.468 --> 00:00:21.501
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> How are you?

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:22.801
You’re looking great.

00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:25.454
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Thanks. I’m well.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:26.786
How about you?

00:00:27.646 --> 00:00:28.765
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> I’m OK.

00:00:31.001 --> 00:00:33.680
Hey, it’s starting to rain.

00:00:34.364 --> 00:00:35.685
Would you like a coffee?

00:00:36.473 --> 00:00:40.227
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Oh, thanks, Steve, but I have a meeting in an hour.

00:00:40.495 --> 00:00:42.381
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> Oh, come on Jenny.

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:43.680
I’d like to talk to you.

00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:46.915
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> OK. A quick coffee.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.727
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> Jenny, I’d like to ask you something.

00:01:16.862 --> 00:01:17.635
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Yes?

00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:23.143
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> There’s an exhibition of Picasso at the MOMA next week.

00:01:23.144 --> 00:01:25.560
I know you love Picasso.

00:01:26.612 --> 00:01:29.558
Would you like to come with me?

00:01:30.806 --> 00:01:31.866
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Listen, Steve.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.148
I’m really busy at work at the moment.

00:01:35.818 --> 00:01:37.822
Next week isn’t a good week for me.

00:01:38.218 --> 00:01:40.543
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> Sure. No problem.

00:01:42.679 --> 00:01:44.596
Maybe we can meet one evening,

00:01:45.762 --> 00:01:50.279
when you have more time and… have dinner or see a show?

00:01:54.353 --> 00:01:55.579
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Listen, Steve.

00:01:57.147 --> 00:01:59.070
I don’t think it’s a good idea.

00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:02.356
But thanks.

00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:06.514
Oh, look at the time!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.240
I need to go.

00:02:09.197 --> 00:02:10.408
Let’s ask for the check.